  "body": "## Documentation, Benchmarks, and Utilities\n\n### Documentation\n- `docs/theory/00-index.md` to `06-5-levels.md` — full mathematical foundation\n- `docs/invariants.md` — 8 mathematical principles with proofs and tests\n- `docs/decision-matrix.md` — D1–D4 decision guidance\n- `docs/hardware-compatibility.md` — CPU→mode table for 6 configs\n- `docs/findings-cpu-universal.md` — 4 real bugs found during research\n- `docs/training/acdc-rect-training-spec.md` — ACDC rectangular training spec\n- `examples/` — 3 D4 persona walkthroughs (medical, legal, finance)\n- Updated `README.md`, `ROADMAP.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `NEXT_STEPS.md`\n- `verification-report.md` — AC-01…AC-13 validation\n\n### Benchmarks\n- `benchmarks/` — FWHT AVX2 benchmark + methodology + JSON/MD results\n- `utils/bench_publish.py` — CLI for publishing benchmark results\n\n### Utilities\n- `utils/extract_acdc_diagonal.py` — ACDC diagonal extraction\n- `utils/*_benchmark.py` — per-kernel benchmarks (WHT, FWHT, tropical, HRR)\n- `utils/rag_demo.py` — CPU RAG demo\n\n**Part of a split from original PR #567.**",
